==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 5~8 seconds<sup>150f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Madam Peng]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threats here are Madam Peng and Le'boin. However, if you have already collected the [[Treasure]]s from [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3, you'll find that your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] can take care of it just fine.

